                         id="d182e571">Residents:      Elmer, Fudd, Marvin, Pepe
Buddies:        Daffy, Foghorn</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">First, the residents and buddies are assigned to the system user
      groups. Second, the user groups need to be assigned to the action
      groups.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The following tables show how the groups could be assigned.</fo:block>
