                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Checks two {@code UserAdminPermission} objects for equality. Checks that
 {@code obj} is a {@code UserAdminPermission}, and has the same name and
 actions as this object.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
